<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Ferosa - 140,000 tonnes Porto Bolivar/Hadera 20/2-5/3 $7.00 fio 50,000 shinc/35,000 shex Cetragpa.</p>
<p>ORE - Doceriver - 150,000 tonnes Cape Lambert/Redcar mid Feb $8.00/$8.00 fio six days shinc British Steel.</p>
<p>Rhodos - 130,000 tonnes Tuburao/Qingdao end Feb $10.10 fio scale load/10,000 shinc Sinotrans (amended).</p>
</text>
